---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Accueil · NESDZ"
  description="NESDZ : météo, terrains proches, documents officiels et lecture pilote pour préparer un vol plus lucidement."
>
  <section class="hero home-top-section">
    <div class="container home-top-container">
      <article class="card home-hero-card">
        <div class="home-hero-mark" aria-hidden="true">
          <img src="/logo.png" alt="" loading="eager" />
        </div>

        <div class="home-kicker">Météo · Terrains · Lecture pilote</div>

        <h1>Lire le terrain avant le départ.</h1>

        <p class="home-lead">
          Météo, terrains proches, documents officiels et lecture pilote pour
          préparer un vol plus lucidement, sans remplacer les sources officielles.
        </p>

        <div class="home-hero-actions">
          <a class="btn home-primary-btn" href="/outils/">Préparer un vol</a>
        </div>

        <div class="home-hero-links" aria-label="Accès secondaires NESDZ">
          <a href="/modeles/">Voir l’annuaire ULM</a>
        </div>

        <p class="home-hero-note">
          Pour la préparation du vol, les services officiels en vigueur restent la référence.
        </p>
      </article>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="container home-coach-section" aria-labelledby="home-coach-title">
    <article class="home-coach-card">
      <div class="home-coach-copy">
        <div class="home-coach-kicker"><span aria-hidden="true">●</span> NOUVEAU · COACH THÉORIQUE</div>
        <h2 id="home-coach-title">Préparez le théorique ULM comme une mission.</h2>
        <p>
          QCM expliqués, navigation générée par calcul, examen blanc de 60 questions
          et tableau de progression par thème.
        </p>
        <div class="home-coach-features" aria-label="Fonctionnalités du coach">
          <span>40 questions sourcées</span>
          <span>8 000+ variantes calculées</span>
          <span>Progression locale</span>
        </div>
        <a class="btn home-coach-button" href="/coach/">
          Ouvrir le coach théorique
          <span aria-hidden="true">→</span>
        </a>
      </div>
      <div class="home-coach-instrument" aria-hidden="true">
        <div class="home-coach-dial">
          <span class="home-coach-dial-label">OBJECTIF</span>
          <strong>75%</strong>
          <small>SEUIL EXAMEN</small>
          <i></i>
        </div>
        <div class="home-coach-readouts">
          <span><small>MODE</small><strong>TRAINING</strong></span>
          <span><small>MODULE</small><strong>NAV · MET · SERA</strong></span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </article>
  </section>

  <section class="container home-model-section">
    <div class="card">
      <div class="pad">
        <div class="home-section-head">
          <div>
            <h2>Modèles en vedette</h2>
            <p class="home-section-intro compact">
              Quelques machines déjà enrichies pour repartir vite vers des comparaisons utiles.
            </p>
          </div>
          <a class="home-text-link" href="/modeles/">Voir l’annuaire ULM</a>
        </div>

        <div class="home-model-grid">
          <article class="home-model-card">
            <a class="home-model-overlay" href="/modeles/aeroprakt-a-22-foxbat/" aria-label="Ouvrir la fiche modèle : Aeroprakt A-22 (Foxbat)"></a>
            <div class="home-model-card-inner">
              <div class="home-model-media">
                <img src="/images/ulm/AeroPrakt-A22-Foxbat.jpg" alt="Aeroprakt A-22 Foxbat" loading="lazy" />
              </div>
              <div class="home-model-copy">
                <div class="home-model-topline">
                  <h3>Aeroprakt A-22 (Foxbat)</h3>
                  <span class="pill">Enrichie</span>
                </div>
                <p>Aeroprakt · Multiaxe · 2 places · Rotax 912 UL / 912 ULS · Croisière ~150 km/h</p>
                <div class="home-model-tags">
                  <a class="pill home-model-tag" href="/tags/stol/">stol</a>
                  <a class="pill home-model-tag" href="/tags/ecole/">ecole</a>
                  <a class="pill home-model-tag" href="/tags/aluminium/">aluminium</a>
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>
          </article>

          <article class="home-model-card">
            <a class="home-model-overlay" href="/modeles/aeroprakt-a-32-vixxen/" aria-label="Ouvrir la fiche modèle : Aeroprakt A-32 Vixxen"></a>
            <div class="home-model-card-inner">
              <div class="home-model-media">
                <img src="/images/ulm/AeroPrakt-A32-Vixxen.jpg" alt="Aeroprakt A-32 Vixxen" loading="lazy" />
              </div>
              <div class="home-model-copy">
                <div class="home-model-topline">
                  <h3>Aeroprakt A-32 Vixxen</h3>
                  <span class="pill">Enrichie</span>
                </div>
                <p>Aeroprakt · Multiaxe · 2 places · Rotax 912 ULS · Croisière ~175 km/h</p>
                <div class="home-model-tags">
                  <a class="pill home-model-tag" href="/tags/voyage/">voyage</a>
                  <a class="pill home-model-tag" href="/tags/rapide/">rapide</a>
                  <a class="pill home-model-tag" href="/tags/aluminium/">aluminium</a>
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>
          </article>

          <article class="home-model-card">
            <a class="home-model-overlay" href="/modeles/aerospool-wt9-dynamic/" aria-label="Ouvrir la fiche modèle : Aerospool WT9 Dynamic"></a>
            <div class="home-model-card-inner">
              <div class="home-model-media">
                <img src="/images/ulm/aerospool-wt9.jpg" alt="Aerospool WT9 Dynamic" loading="lazy" />
              </div>
              <div class="home-model-copy">
                <div class="home-model-topline">
                  <h3>Aerospool WT9 Dynamic</h3>
                  <span class="pill">Enrichie</span>
                </div>
                <p>Aerospool · Multiaxe · 2 places · Rotax 912 ULS</p>
                <div class="home-model-tags">
                  <a class="pill home-model-tag" href="/tags/voyage/">voyage</a>
                  <a class="pill home-model-tag" href="/tags/rapide/">rapide</a>
                  <a class="pill home-model-tag" href="/tags/composite/">composite</a>
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>
          </article>

          <article class="home-model-card">
            <a class="home-model-overlay" href="/modeles/autogyro-cavalon/" aria-label="Ouvrir la fiche modèle : AutoGyro Cavalon"></a>
            <div class="home-model-card-inner">
              <div class="home-model-media">
                <img src="/images/ulm/AutoGyroCavalon.jpg" alt="AutoGyro Cavalon" loading="lazy" />
              </div>
              <div class="home-model-copy">
                <div class="home-model-topline">
                  <h3>AutoGyro Cavalon</h3>
                  <span class="pill">Enrichie</span>
                </div>
                <p>AutoGyro GmbH · Autogire · 2 places · Rotax 915 iS</p>
                <div class="home-model-tags">
                  <a class="pill home-model-tag" href="/tags/voyage/">voyage</a>
                  <a class="pill home-model-tag" href="/tags/composite/">composite</a>
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>
          </article>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="container home-themes-section">
    <div class="card">
      <div class="pad home-themes-wrap">
        <div class="home-section-head home-section-head--tight">
          <div>
            <h2>Explorer par thèmes</h2>
            <p class="home-section-intro compact">
              Une entrée courte vers les profils de machines de l’annuaire.
            </p>
          </div>
          <a class="home-text-link" href="/tags/">Tous les tags</a>
        </div>

        <div class="home-theme-groups">
          <div class="home-theme-group">
            <strong>Modèles ULM</strong>
            <div class="home-theme-pills">
              <a class="pill" href="/tags/voyage/">voyage</a>
              <a class="pill" href="/tags/ecole/">école</a>
              <a class="pill" href="/tags/polyvalent/">polyvalent</a>
              <a class="pill" href="/tags/stol/">stol</a>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <style is:global>
    /* Section d'accueil du haut */
    .home-top-section {
      padding: 44px 0 24px;
    }

    .home-top-container {
      max-width: 960px;
      margin: 0 auto;
      width: 100%;
    }

    /* Carte principale Hero - Design cockpit premium */
    .home-hero-card {
      position: relative;
      overflow: hidden;
      padding: 40px 40px 44px;
      border-radius: 30px;
      border: 1px solid rgba(181, 221, 255, 0.12);
      box-shadow: 0 30px 74px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.35);
      background:
        linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(4, 9, 23, 0.28), rgba(4, 9, 23, 0.84)),
        linear-gradient(90deg, rgba(4, 9, 23, 0.90) 8%, rgba(4, 9, 23, 0.56) 54%, rgba(4, 9, 23, 0.88) 100%),
        url('/images/ulm/AeroPrakt-A32-Vixxen.jpg') center/cover no-repeat;
    }

    /* Effet de grille technique aéronautique en arrière-plan */
    .home-hero-card::before {
      content: "";
      position: absolute;
      inset: 0;
      background-image:
        linear-gradient(rgba(160, 200, 240, 0.032) 1px, transparent 1px),
        linear-gradient(90deg, rgba(160, 200, 240, 0.032) 1px, transparent 1px);
      background-size: 56px 56px;
      opacity: 0.32;
      pointer-events: none;
    }

    .home-hero-card::after {
      content: "";
      position: absolute;
      inset: auto 0 0 0;
      height: 180px;
      background: linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(3, 8, 20, 0), rgba(3, 8, 20, 0.78));
      pointer-events: none;
    }

    .home-hero-card > * {
      position: relative;
      z-index: 3;
    }

    /* Badge Logo */
    .home-hero-mark {
      width: 82px;
      height: 82px;
      margin: 2px 0 22px;
      border-radius: 24px;
      background:
        linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08), rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.03)),
        rgba(7, 20, 43, 0.80);
      border: 1px solid rgba(210, 236, 255, 0.16);
      box-shadow: 0 20px 42px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.22);
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
    }

    .home-hero-mark img {
      width: 66%;
      height: 66%;
      object-fit: contain;
      opacity: 0.94;
      filter: drop-shadow(0 10px 24px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.22));
    }

    /* Kicker d'en-tête */
    .home-kicker {
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      padding: 9px 16px;
      border-radius: 999px;
      background: rgba(7, 29, 60, 0.54);
      border: 1px solid rgba(72, 194, 255, 0.18);
      box-shadow: inset 0 1px 0 rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.045);
      color: #7fdcff;
      font-size: 0.88rem;
      font-weight: 650;
      letter-spacing: 0.02em;
      margin-bottom: 18px;
      text-transform: uppercase;
    }

    .home-hero-card h1 {
      margin: 0;
      max-width: 15ch;
      font-size: clamp(2.3rem, 4.5vw, 3.8rem);
      line-height: 1.05;
      letter-spacing: -0.04em;
      text-wrap: balance;
    }

    .home-lead {
      margin: 18px 0 0;
      max-width: 48ch;
      font-size: clamp(1rem, 1.45vw, 1.15rem);
      line-height: 1.68;
      color: rgba(237, 244, 255, 0.88);
    }

    .home-hero-actions {
      display: flex;
      gap: 12px;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      margin-top: 24px;
      margin-bottom: 14px;
    }

    /* Bouton principal de vol */
    .home-primary-btn {
      min-height: 58px;
      padding-inline: 28px;
      border-radius: 20px;
      font-weight: 800;
      letter-spacing: 0.01em;
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      text-decoration: none;
      background: linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(72, 194, 255, 0.9) 0%, rgba(27, 173, 240, 0.85) 100%);
      border: 1px solid rgba(231, 248, 255, 0.62);
      color: #071122 !important;
      box-shadow: 0 16px 38px rgba(12, 86, 130, 0.24);
      transition: transform 0.12s ease, filter 0.15s ease, box-shadow 0.15s ease;
    }

    .home-primary-btn:hover {
      transform: translateY(-1px);
      filter: brightness(1.06);
      box-shadow: 0 18px 42px rgba(12, 86, 130, 0.32);
    }

    .home-hero-links {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 12px;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      margin-top: 14px;
      margin-bottom: 14px;
      font-size: 0.96rem;
      font-weight: 600;
      color: var(--muted);
    }

    .home-hero-links a {
      color: #bde9ff;
      text-decoration: none;
    }

    .home-hero-links a:hover {
      color: #ffffff;
      text-decoration: underline;
    }

    .home-hero-note {
      margin: 14px 0 0;
      max-width: 52ch;
      font-size: 0.92rem;
      line-height: 1.6;
      color: rgba(231, 238, 245, 0.68);
    }

    /* Sections d'annuaire et de modèles */
    .home-model-section,
    .home-themes-section {
      padding: 12px 0 24px;
    }

    .home-model-section .card,
    .home-themes-section .card {
      border-radius: 30px;
      border: 1px solid rgba(181, 221, 255, 0.09);
      box-shadow: 0 30px 74px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.30);
      background: linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.04), rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.014) 22%), rgba(7, 17, 34, 0.88);
    }

    .home-model-section .pad,
    .home-themes-section .pad {
      padding: 26px;
    }

    .home-section-head {
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
      align-items: flex-end;
      gap: 16px;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      margin-bottom: 18px;
    }

    .home-section-head--tight {
      margin-bottom: 2px;
    }

    .home-section-head h2 {
      margin: 0;
      font-size: clamp(1.4rem, 2.5vw, 2.1rem);
      color: var(--text-main);
    }

    .home-section-intro {
      margin: 8px 0 0;
      color: rgba(231, 238, 245, 0.72);
      line-height: 1.68;
    }

    .home-section-intro.compact {
      margin-top: 6px;
      max-width: 54ch;
    }

    .home-text-link {
      color: #bde9ff;
      text-decoration: none;
      font-size: 0.96rem;
      font-weight: 700;
      white-space: nowrap;
      letter-spacing: 0.01em;
    }

    .home-text-link:hover {
      color: #ffffff;
      text-decoration: underline;
    }

    /* Grille des fiches d'aéronefs */
    .home-model-grid {
      margin-top: 8px;
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr));
      gap: 18px;
    }

    .home-model-card {
      position: relative;
      overflow: hidden;
      border: 1px solid rgba(182, 222, 255, 0.09);
      border-radius: 26px;
      background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.024);
      box-shadow: 0 22px 50px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.22);
      transition: transform 0.18s ease, border-color 0.18s ease, box-shadow 0.18s ease, background 0.18s ease;
    }

    .home-model-card:hover,
    .home-model-card:focus-within {
      transform: translateY(-1px);
      border-color: rgba(127, 220, 255, 0.18);
      box-shadow: 0 18px 34px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.18);
      background: rgba(8, 26, 52, 0.52);
    }

    .home-model-overlay {
      position: absolute;
      inset: 0;
      z-index: 2;
      border-radius: 26px;
    }

    .home-model-card-inner {
      position: relative;
      z-index: 1;
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: 140px minmax(0, 1fr);
      gap: 16px;
      padding: 16px;
      align-items: center;
    }

    .home-model-media {
      width: 140px;
      aspect-ratio: 16 / 9;
      border-radius: 16px;
      overflow: hidden;
      background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.03);
      border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08);
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
    }

    .home-model-media img {
      width: 100%;
      height: 100%;
      object-fit: cover;
      display: block;
    }

    .home-model-copy {
      min-width: 0;
    }

    .home-coach-section {
      margin-top: 6px;
      margin-bottom: 28px;
    }

    .home-coach-card {
      position: relative;
      overflow: hidden;
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1.35fr) minmax(260px, .65fr);
      gap: 32px;
      align-items: center;
      padding: 34px 38px;
      border-radius: 27px;
      border: 1px solid rgba(104, 225, 178, .22);
      background:
        linear-gradient(rgba(99, 224, 181, .035) 1px, transparent 1px),
        linear-gradient(90deg, rgba(99, 224, 181, .035) 1px, transparent 1px),
        radial-gradient(500px 250px at 88% 40%, rgba(47, 209, 150, .14), transparent 70%),
        linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(8, 27, 45, .98), rgba(4, 13, 27, .98));
      background-size: 38px 38px, 38px 38px, auto, auto;
      box-shadow: 0 24px 60px rgba(0,0,0,.28), inset 0 1px 0 rgba(255,255,255,.04);
    }

    .home-coach-card::after {
      content: "";
      position: absolute;
      inset: 0;
      pointer-events: none;
      border-radius: inherit;
      box-shadow: inset 0 0 60px rgba(31, 193, 139, .045);
    }

    .home-coach-copy,
    .home-coach-instrument {
      position: relative;
      z-index: 1;
    }

    .home-coach-kicker {
      color: #69e6b1;
      font: 800 .74rem/1.2 var(--mono);
      letter-spacing: .12em;
    }

    .home-coach-kicker span {
      text-shadow: 0 0 10px #55e5a7;
    }

    .home-coach-copy h2 {
      max-width: 690px;
      margin-top: 11px;
      font-size: clamp(1.8rem, 3.1vw, 2.75rem);
    }

    .home-coach-copy p {
      max-width: 690px;
      color: rgba(225, 238, 250, .75);
    }

    .home-coach-features {
      display: flex;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      gap: 8px;
      margin: 18px 0 22px;
    }

    .home-coach-features span {
      padding: 7px 10px;
      border: 1px solid rgba(103, 226, 177, .16);
      border-radius: 8px;
      color: #a8d9c8;
      background: rgba(38, 159, 116, .08);
      font: 700 .68rem/1.2 var(--mono);
    }

    .home-coach-button {
      min-height: 55px;
      width: fit-content;
      color: #03150e;
      background: linear-gradient(180deg, #78edbd, #35bc82);
      border-color: #baffdc;
    }

    .home-coach-button:hover,
    .home-coach-button:focus-visible {
      color: #03150e;
      border-color: #e2fff1;
      background: linear-gradient(180deg, #8cf2c8, #3fc78c);
      box-shadow: 0 0 0 4px rgba(69, 220, 160, .12), 0 16px 32px rgba(0,0,0,.28);
    }

    .home-coach-instrument {
      display: grid;
      place-items: center;
      gap: 14px;
    }

    .home-coach-dial {
      width: 210px;
      aspect-ratio: 1;
      border-radius: 50%;
      display: grid;
      place-content: center;
      text-align: center;
      position: relative;
      border: 2px solid rgba(102, 234, 183, .28);
      background:
        repeating-conic-gradient(from 0deg, rgba(104, 234, 181, .46) 0 1deg, transparent 1deg 10deg),
        radial-gradient(circle, #0a2530 0 61%, #06141f 62%);
      box-shadow: inset 0 0 34px rgba(50, 210, 154, .13), 0 0 40px rgba(50, 210, 154, .08);
    }

    .home-coach-dial::before {
      content: "";
      position: absolute;
      inset: 21px;
      border-radius: 50%;
      background: rgba(4, 19, 28, .92);
      border: 1px solid rgba(111, 232, 186, .14);
    }

    .home-coach-dial > * {
      position: relative;
      z-index: 2;
    }

    .home-coach-dial-label,
    .home-coach-dial small {
      color: #86b6a6;
      font: 700 .58rem/1.2 var(--mono);
      letter-spacing: .1em;
    }

    .home-coach-dial strong {
      color: #72edb9;
      font: 900 2.55rem/1.1 var(--mono);
      text-shadow: 0 0 22px rgba(91, 233, 178, .25);
    }

    .home-coach-dial i {
      position: absolute;
      width: 5px;
      height: 66px;
      left: calc(50% - 2px);
      bottom: 50%;
      z-index: 1;
      transform: rotate(55deg);
      transform-origin: 50% 100%;
      background: linear-gradient(#ffc76e, transparent);
      box-shadow: 0 0 12px rgba(255, 199, 110, .5);
    }

    .home-coach-readouts {
      width: min(100%, 270px);
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: .8fr 1.2fr;
      gap: 7px;
    }

    .home-coach-readouts span {
      padding: 9px 10px;
      border: 1px solid rgba(115, 226, 184, .12);
      background: rgba(5, 21, 31, .82);
      border-radius: 9px;
    }

    .home-coach-readouts small,
    .home-coach-readouts strong {
      display: block;
      font-family: var(--mono);
    }

    .home-coach-readouts small { color: #708f8a; font-size: .55rem; }
    .home-coach-readouts strong { color: #9ee3c9; font-size: .64rem; margin-top: 2px; }

    .home-model-topline {
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
      align-items: flex-start;
      gap: 10px;
    }

    .home-model-topline h3 {
      margin: 0;
      font-size: 1.24rem;
      line-height: 1.15;
      max-width: 18ch;
    }

    .home-model-copy p {
      margin: 10px 0 0;
      color: rgba(231, 238, 245, 0.72);
      line-height: 1.62;
      font-size: 0.93rem;
      display: -webkit-box;
      -webkit-line-clamp: 3;
      -webkit-box-orient: vertical;
      overflow: hidden;
    }

    .home-model-tags,
    .home-theme-pills {
      display: flex;
      gap: 10px;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      margin-top: 14px;
    }

    .home-model-tag {
      position: relative;
      z-index: 3;
      text-decoration: none;
    }

    /* Grille des thèmes unifiée et centrée */
    .home-theme-groups {
      display: block;
      margin-top: 16px;
    }

    .home-theme-group {
      padding: 20px;
      border-radius: 20px;
